      "message": "test: cover missing BIP352 cases\n\nAdd unit tests for BIP352 cases that are not adequately\ncovered by the existing test suite.\nThe tests cover scan labels, P2PKH public key extraction,\ninvalid public keys, P2SH input eligibility, Taproot\nscript-path spends, annex handling, prevouts summary\nerrors, invalid Silent Payments destinations, label copy\nassignment, maximum-size control blocks, and scanning\ntransactions without valid x-only outputs.\nThese cases were identified through manual mutation\ntesting and bcore-mutation.",
